        "original_id": "6f517a2f-c260-59c8-bf42-4b34c6326736",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Roberto Sánchez-Ocampo, Sandro, Sandro de América, Julio Saraceni, Elena Sedova\n- Works: The Desire to Live\n- Topics: Argentine film, romantic musical film, Argentine music and acting\n\nFacts:\n- Roberto Sánchez-Ocampo was born on August 19, 1945.\n- Roberto Sánchez-Ocampo was an Argentine singer and actor.\n- Roberto Sánchez-Ocampo was better known by the artist names Sandro and Sandro de América, and was also called Gitano and the Argentine Elvis.\n- The Desire to Live is a 1973 Argentine romantic musical film.\n- The Desire to Live is also known in Spanish as El Deseo de vivir.\n- The Desire to Live was directed by Julio Saraceni and starred Sandro and Elena Sedova.\n- Roberto Sánchez-Ocampo died on January 4, 2010.",
